    if has_passport:
        print("Allowed")
    else:
        print("Need passport")
```

What will it output?
```
age = 15
has_passport = True
if age >= 18:
    if has_passport:
        print("Allowed")
    else:
        print("Need passport")
```

How many iterations?
```
for i in range(3):
    for j in range(4):
        print(i, j)
```

What will it output?
```
for i in range(2):
    for j in range(2):
        print(i, j)
```

What will it output?
```
for i in range(3):
    for j in range(3):
        if j == 1:
            break
        print(i, j)
```

